# RouteWeave Alembic (async SQLAlchemy)

Generic single-database configuration with asyncpg driver.

## Usage

```bash
cd api

# Auto-generate a migration from current models
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

# Run pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Downgrade one revision
alembic downgrade -1
```

Environment variables:
- `DATABASE_URL` — required. Must use `postgresql+asyncpg://` scheme.
